  <Intro>k__BackingField: The Kingsgate is the only road through the mountains to the capital, and the king's best knights hold it. Take it before the snows close the passes.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: The Kingsgate is yours, and beyond it the capital lies open. The king sends a herald. Grom sends the herald back without his trumpet.
  <Goal>k__BackingField: Take the Kingsgate.
  <Loss>k__BackingField: Win by day 75.
